        "bookId": 36,
        "chapterId": 161,
        "headingId": 541,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>2F77 &amp; XH3ZK9 Neoplasms of uncertain behaviour of male genital organs &amp; Serous borderline tumour, NOS</p>\r\n",
